/-!
# Reusable API for categories over a base

Compatibility aggregate for the project extensions of mathlib's canonical `BasedCategory`,
`BasedFunctor`, and `BasedNatTrans` owners. New consumers should import the smallest relevant
leaf: strict `Basic`, pseudo-slice `OverIso`, fiber actions, equivalence data or its
bicategorical/fiberwise/hom-category consequences, heterogeneous `Precomposition`/
`Postcomposition` and `Over.map` packaging, `NaturalIso`, or the over-identity
natural-transformation bridge. `CategoryOfElements` owns the functor over the base generated by
a section of a pulled-back type-valued functor.
-/
